{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation pushed for review as Gerrit change 2367 (commit 3ba23c6865ff).\n\nLocal gate results in the worktree (venv on PATH, `rebar.__file__` confirmed at /Users/joeoakhart/uv-pin-56b7/src/rebar/__init__.py):\n- `make lint` PASS — including the new `python scripts/check_uv_pin.py` step and zizmor over the workflow set (no findings).\n- `make typecheck` PASS — 686 source files.\n- `pytest tests/unit/test_uv_pin_guard.py` — 11 passed.\n- `pytest tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py test_mypy_ratchet.py test_complexity_baseline.py test_capabilities.py test_cli_registry_full_extra.py` — 158 passed (the pyproject/workflow-sensitive neighbours).\n\n**Proof the guard can FAIL, against a real call site rather than only a fixture.** A `version: \"0.11.0\"` input was added to the genuine `release.yml` setup-uv step, the gate run, then the file restored:\n\n    --- SKEWED ONE REAL CALL SITE (release.yml) ---\n    check_uv_pin: .github/workflows/release.yml (astral-sh/setup-uv@ae62891fec2bb8e7d6c99fc78c9fec3a63790f8d): setup-uv step sets 'version: 0.11.0'. That input is resolved AHEAD of the pyproject.toml scan, so this job would silently use a different uv from every other job. Remove it and let [tool.uv] required-version apply\n    exit=1\n    --- RESTORED ---\n    exit=0\n    git diff --name-only -- .github/workflows   ->   (empty)\n\nThe unit tests codify the same and three more skews permanently: `version-file:`, a range specifier (`>=`, `~=`, bare `0.12.7`, `==0.12.*`), an absent pin, and a shadowing root `uv.toml`.\n\nNo `.github/workflows/**` file is modified by the change — `git diff --name-only origin/main -- .github/workflows` is empty — which is the point of the mechanism: one pyproject.toml line fixes all 25 call sites.\n\nStill outstanding: the real-CI-log verification with its liveness anchor, against this change's own Verified run."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1787972263893359001,"uuid":"f3ef4189-92f4-4c0d-96e3-b29def4b29e2"}